SCOPE. This licence covers the Escape Game Engine: everything in this repository
EXCEPT `games/demo`.

`games/demo` is a complete game rather than a sample, kept here so the engine can
be seen working and so its tests have real data. It is licensed separately; see
`games/LICENSE`. The commercial games are not in this repository at all.

`games/tests` is engine test code and IS covered by this licence.

